# Scarecrow Guide: "{1}: Add one mana of any color. Activate only once each turn." (CR 605.1a, 602.5b). Turn 1 Bot1 casts it off two Moxen and
# pays {1} (Mox Sapphire) for red, which is exactly one mana in the pool and casts a Lightning Bolt; a second activation the same turn is refused
# although Mox Pearl could pay it. On turn 2, Bot2's turn, it is offered again (a new turn, not a new controller's turn) and makes {G}
# for Mox Pearl; so it does on turn 3, for {W}. Colorless is not a color and is refused.

